# An unstable export must not acknowledge completion while reconcile is owed.
# Otherwise P releases the source tombstone before the stable successor scans.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceOwedExportCompletesReseed
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: an owed export completes the re-seed and releases tombstone protection before its stable successor
PERTURBS: Reap
BOUNDS: Third = TRUE, Reattach = FALSE, MaxHlc = 2

--- FIND
    /\ detached \/ (DeleteShipped /\ ~(fellOff /\ (~booted \/ owed)))
--- REPLACE
    /\ detached \/ (DeleteShipped /\ ~(fellOff /\ ~booted))
--- END
